# Deployments upload only what the web app needs. Never upload credentials, local database data or research material.
# Directory patterns are anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `research` also matched app/research (the page).
.env*
!.env.example
/.pgdata*
/.vercel
/.cache
/research
/tests
/docs
/database
/scripts
/supabase/*
!/supabase/prod-ca-2021.crt
*.log
/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
/.restricted
